<section><a id=3D"Welcome_to_Apache_Maven"></a>
<h1>Welcome to Apache Maven</h1>

<p>
Apache Maven is a build tool for Java projects. Using a project object mode=
l (POM), Maven manages a project's compilation, testing, and documentation.=
 </p>

<p>
You can find more information in the "About Maven" section of the sidebar. =
This includes an in-depth description of <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.or=
g/what-is-maven.html">what Maven is</a> and a list of some of its main feat=
ures. </p>

<p>
This site is separated into the following sections: </p>

<table class=3D"table table-striped">

<tbody><tr class=3D"a">

<th class=3D"home-section-heading" rowspan=3D"3">Use</th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links">
<a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/download.html">Download</a>, <a href=3D=
"https://maven.apache.org/install.html">Install</a>, <a href=3D"https://mav=
en.apache.org/configure.html">Configure</a>, <a href=3D"https://maven.apach=
e.org/run.html">Run</a> Maven </th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links">
<a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/plugins/index.html">Maven Plugins</a> a=
nd <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/extensions/index.html">Maven Extensi=
ons</a> </th>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"b">

<td>Information for those needing to build a project that uses Maven</td>

<td>
Lists of plugins and extensions to help with your builds. </td>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"a">

<td><b>Maven 4</b>: Learn <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/whatsnewinmav=
en4.html">what's new</a> and <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/guides/min=
i/guide-migration-to-mvn4.html">how to migrate a project</a> to Maven 4. Th=
e <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/tools/mvnup.html">Maven Upgrade Tool<=
/a> provides upgrade support.</td>

<td>
Upcoming: How to migrate plugins to the new Maven 4 API? </td>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"b">

<th class=3D"home-section-heading" rowspan=3D"2">Extend</th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links"><a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/plugin=
-developers/index.html">Write Maven Plugins</a></th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links"><a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/reposi=
tory/index.html">Improve the Maven Central Repository</a></th>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"a">

<td>
Information for developers writing Maven plugins. </td>

<td>
Information for those who may or may not use Maven, but are interested in g=
etting project metadata into the <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/reposi=
tory/index.html">central repository</a>. </td>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"b">

<th class=3D"home-section-heading" rowspan=3D"2">Contribute</th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links"><a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/guides=
/development/guide-helping.html">Help Maven</a></th>

<th class=3D"home-section-links"><a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/develo=
pers/index.html">Develop Maven</a></th>
</tr>

<tr class=3D"a">

<td>
Information if you'd like to get involved. Maven is an open source communit=
y and welcomes contributions. </td>

<td>
Information for those who are currently Maven developers, or who are intere=
sted in contributing to the Maven project itself. </td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>

<p>
Each guide is divided into a number of trails to get you started on a parti=
cular topic, and includes a reference area and a "cookbook" of common examp=
les. </p>

<p>
You can access the guides at any time from the left navigation. If you are =
looking for a quick reference, you can use the <a href=3D"https://maven.apa=
che.org/guides/index.html">documentation index</a>. </p>

<section><section><a id=3D"How_to_Get_Support"></a>
<h3 id=3D"how-to-get-support">How to Get Support<a class=3D"anchorjs-link "=
 aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" href=3D"https://mav=
en.apache.org/#how-to-get-support" style=3D"font: 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; p=
adding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h3>

<p>
Support for Maven is available in a variety of different forms. </p>

<p>
To get started, search the documentation, <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.o=
rg/issue-management.html">issue management system</a>, the <a href=3D"https=
://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/MAVEN" class=3D"externalLink">wiki</=
a>, or the <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/mailing-lists.html">mailing =
list archives</a> to see if the problem has been solved or reported before.=
 </p>

<p>
If the problem has not been reported before, the recommended way to get hel=
p is to subscribe to the <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/mailing-lists.=
html">Maven Users Mailing list</a>. Many other users and Maven developers w=
ill answer your questions there, and the answer will be archived for others=
 in the future. </p>

<p>
You can also reach the Maven developers on <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.=
org/community.html">Slack</a>. </p>

</section><section><a id=3D"Apache_Software_Foundation"></a>
<h3 id=3D"apache-software-foundation">Apache Software Foundation<a class=3D=
"anchorjs-link " aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" hre=
f=3D"https://maven.apache.org/#apache-software-foundation" style=3D"font: 1=
em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h3>

<p>
Maven is a part of the Apache Software Foundation. We'd like to <a href=3D"=
https://www.apache.org/foundation/thanks.html" class=3D"externalLink">thank=
 the sponsors</a> that provide financial assistance to the foundation. For =
more information on how you can support the foundation, see the <a href=3D"=
https://www.apache.org/foundation/sponsorship.html" class=3D"externalLink">=
sponsorship</a> page. </p>

<p>
<a href=3D"https://www.apache.org/events/current-event.html" class=3D"exter=
nalLink"> <img src=3D"https://www.apache.org/events/current-event-234x60.pn=
g" alt=3D"Apache Events" style=3D"float: left"> </a> You can also attend <a=
 href=3D"https://www.apache.org/events/current-event.html" class=3D"externa=
lLink">Apache Events</a>. Ask on the <a href=3D"https://maven.apache.org/ma=
iling-lists.html">Maven User mailing list</a> if Maven team members will be=
 there. It can be a great opportunity to meet them. </p>
</section></section></section>

